{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1520.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a385c28ec12932ffd5cf9435f6fde363b9bf3c412ddb8418f8a572d9d7654488","ja":"あっ、育。おやぶんが\n走ってどっかにいっちゃったんだけど、どうかしたの？","zh":"啊，育。老大\n跑去什么地方了，出什么事了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1520.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2073a475deaffb4247feded34ecf0db7db59cd0eb63651740f6413d700b4d239","ja":"急なお仕事が入ったんだって。\n打ち合わせまでにはもどれるって、言ってたけど。","zh":"说是突然有了紧急工作。\n不过也说了会在碰头会之前赶回来的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1520.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3a9d2d02726149c426d2fc6c7939d870dc16026f52a5f59c945c18d2ba15bcc2","ja":"代わりに、打ち合わせのしじと、あとおねがいが\nあるって、メモを書いてくれたんだけど……。","zh":"不过，留了张便签写着碰头的指示，\n还有需要帮忙的事……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1520.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b1de50f01650e4467872f0cfcc361aa44fe2d7a2c9f050f6e9d43396c0b096ad","ja":"……これ、なんて書いてあるの？\n字がぐちゃぐちゃで、あんごうみたいだぞ～。","zh":"……这上面写了什么呀？\n字迹乱糟糟的，简直像暗号一样哦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1520.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d05a2c3e00d1d32eb0aebd61cc5febb9913c839eb12d1dd49f1e403bffd30a1a","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーさん、\nあわてて書いてたから、わたしも読めなくて……。","zh":"●●●●制作人，\n写得太慌慌张张了，连我自己都认不出来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1520.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"20e8825f11684c409c559585adcb3be3360cc14b6404e7a14123d2be67b3112c","ja":"えっと……4時？　14時かな？\n……レッスン……イショウ……？","zh":"那个……4点？还是14点呢？\n……练习课程……服装……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1520.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f3c5bbfa2963900acdc594709f4bdd8ebbc5969d2f6f2a62ed975d1a5f38adb3","ja":"その下は分からなくて……。そのあとは、\nきがえ……ルームで、待ってて……かな？","zh":"下面的我就不知道了……在那之后好像是，\n更衣……室里，等一下……吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1520.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7a9582eb61c33ed0d8e68fad99eef537be948df425be5230095b51224d800bee","ja":"いちばんさいごは、ジムシツ……事務室？\nマ……ク……をもっていって？","zh":"最后一个是，bangongshi……办公室？\n把麦……克……带过去？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1520.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"de7711951aea1d9c1cac74f9fe5ee46b02506ba23eca21b387dcc9cab73a8f7c","ja":"やっぱりわからないぞ！\nおやぶんに電話して、聞いてみようよ～！","zh":"果然还是搞不懂啊！\n给老大打电话问问看吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1520.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e0cc00034564a6081fae53e567ab9e9f34e309b7892897ea63f73d63f54fa113","ja":"うん。でも、●●●●プロデューサーさん、\nでられるのかな……？","zh":"嗯。不过，●●●●制作人\n能出场吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
